{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受短语有时过密、过碎，尤其 S08—S12，容易让观众在人物叙述和音乐感受之间频繁切换；Y 的完整句子在理解心理因果时更顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的短句分层和【】重点突出，让观众即使边听音乐边扫屏幕，也容易抓住每段人物心理的核心变化；感受词又有具体的音乐时点和身体反应，能把情绪变化落实到听觉体验，而不是停留在抽象形容上。Y 的优势是完整句子更自然地交代因果，但左侧长句和右侧词组需要来回整合，且不少感受缺少明确的音乐时序，容易变成对音乐的概括性注释。综合来看，X 更能兼顾叙事抓取、音乐同步和感受细腻度，Y 则在心理解释的连贯性上略胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "16de9a96-8c8f-4a35-a2d4-e8720a27409f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193500662752Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:36:29.112713+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1fed6e196f57f929b16fa5d8518a234f0cf72687541c5d9eecf15a42d1b9b9d2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3